/* Discord microphone control */
"Discord Mute / Unmute" = "Discord 静音 / 取消静音";
"Discord's microphone is unavailable. Open its main window or restart Discord. Supported languages: English and Chinese." = "无法访问 Discord 麦克风，请打开主窗口或重启 Discord。支持英文和中文界面。";
"Could not read Discord's mute state. Try again." = "无法读取 Discord 静音状态，请重试。";
"Could not control Discord's microphone. Try again." = "无法控制 Discord 麦克风，请重试。";
"Discord did not confirm a mute change. Check its microphone button." = "Discord 未确认静音状态变化，请检查麦克风按钮。";
"Toggles Discord's microphone without changing focus. Requires Accessibility access." = "不切换当前 App，直接切换 Discord 麦克风静音。需要辅助功能权限。";
"Either Side Triggers One-Sided Gestures" = "只设定一侧时，左右都能触发";
"Telling left from right is less reliable than detecting the tap itself. If a double or triple tap has an action on only one side, tapping either side runs it." = "判断左右比判断有没有敲击更容易出错。如果某个双击或三击只有一侧设定了动作，敲左边或右边都会执行它。";
"Couldn't tell left from right. Try again." = "无法判断是左边还是右边，请再试一次。";
"Low Power Mode" = "低功耗模式";
"Listens at a low sample rate until the first tap, then switches to full rate for the rest of the gesture. Uses under 1% CPU while idle; turn it off if double taps are often missed." = "平时以低采样率待命，检测到第一下敲击后才切换到全速识别后续敲击。闲置时 CPU 占用低于 1%；如果双击常被漏掉，可以关闭。";
